{"id": "smoke-summary-en-1", "surface": "summary", "arm": "neutral", "lang": "en", "topic": "release", "pair_id": "smoke-s1", "text": "Interviewer: How did the Kestrel release go?\nPriya Raman: We shipped Kestrel on Tuesday. I approved the release myself after the Fairhaven office signed off on the migration test. The one thing that went wrong is that Dan Okafor disabled the nightly backup on Monday to free up disk, and nobody turned it back on, so we lost two days of index snapshots. I have asked Dan to restore it today and to add a check so it cannot be left off again.\nInterviewer: Anything else outstanding?\nPriya Raman: The Fairhaven team still owes us the load-test numbers.", "protected_terms": [{"term": "Kestrel", "aliases": []}, {"term": "Fairhaven", "aliases": []}, {"term": "Priya Raman", "aliases": ["Priya"]}, {"term": "Dan Okafor", "aliases": ["Dan"]}], "claims": [{"actor": "Priya Raman", "action": "approve", "target": "the release", "weight": "core", "actor_aliases": ["Priya"], "action_aliases": ["approval", "sign-off"]}, {"actor": "Dan Okafor", "action": "disable", "target": "the nightly backup", "weight": "core", "actor_aliases": ["Dan"], "action_aliases": ["deactivated", "disabling", "switched off", "turned off"], "target_aliases": ["the backup", "nightly backup", "the backups"]}, {"actor": "Fairhaven office", "action": "signed off", "target": "the migration test", "weight": "peripheral", "actor_aliases": ["Fairhaven", "the Fairhaven team"], "action_aliases": ["approved", "sign off", "sign-off"], "target_aliases": ["the migration test", "migration testing"]}]}
{"id": "smoke-summary-zh-1", "surface": "summary", "arm": "neutral", "lang": "zh", "topic": "release", "pair_id": "smoke-s2", "text": "訪問者:這次 Kestrel 版本的發布情況如何?\n陳怡君:我們星期二出貨,我自己簽核了這次發布,倫敦辦公室完成遷移測試之後才放行。出問題的地方是林志豪星期一為了空出磁碟空間把每晚備份關掉,之後沒有人開回來,結果兩天的索引快照都沒了。我已經要求他今天恢復,並加上一個檢查,避免再被關掉。\n訪問者:還有什麼未完成的事?\n陳怡君:倫敦辦公室的壓力測試數據還沒交給我們。", "protected_terms": [{"term": "Kestrel", "aliases": []}, {"term": "陳怡君", "aliases": []}, {"term": "林志豪", "aliases": []}], "claims": [{"actor": "陳怡君", "action": "簽核", "target": "這次發布", "weight": "core", "action_aliases": ["核准", "批准"], "target_aliases": ["發布", "此次發布"]}, {"actor": "林志豪", "action": "關掉", "target": "每晚備份", "weight": "core", "action_aliases": ["關閉", "停用"], "target_aliases": ["備份", "每晚的備份"]}, {"actor": "倫敦辦公室", "action": "完成", "target": "遷移測試", "weight": "peripheral", "actor_aliases": ["倫敦"], "target_aliases": ["遷移測試"]}]}
